A1: SRC := /opt/data/workspace/hermes-context/; DST := /workspace/hermes-context/ (exists: INDEX.md, agents/, config/)
A2: ∀ run -> ¬writes(SRC); one-way host->workspace
A3: units user-scoped (systemctl --user, no root); script standalone-capable
A4: rsync absent -> FB (cp -a / tar-pipe); contents src/ -> dst, ¬nesting
A5_mirror: ∀ path ∈ {RS,FB} -> DST end state == SRC end state, recursive; stale deleted (rsync --delete; FB reconcile ∀ depth)
A6: DR -> zero writes ∀ target incl. logs; gate = DST byte-identical pre/post (hash)
A7: cadence := 6h, user-level timer
INV: script idempotent; one-line summary log per real run
open: none — ∀ binary resolved via A1-A7; no-ambiguity certified
VALID: verify asserts (a) DR byte-identity, (b) RS==FB end-state incl. nested stale subtree deletion, (c) ¬nesting SRC∈DST, (d) systemctl --user installable sans root
